@host = example.com
@token := abc

# @name list
GET https://{{host}}/items
Accept: application/json

###

### Create item
POST https://{{host}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Trace: one
  two

{
  "name": "widget",
  "tags": ["a", "b"]
}

> {%
  client.log("created");
%}

###

### Submit the form
POST https://{{host}}/form
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

a=1&b=2
